# Admin UI conventions

## Confirm before delete

Never delete a record on the first click. Always open a confirmation dialog (reuse `ConfirmDeleteDialog`) before calling `apiDelete` or any destructive remove.

## Admin list tables (logs-style)

Users, groups, sessions, permissions, and logs list pages should provide:

- Search + filter panel (toggle Show/Hide filters)
- Page size selector and Previous/Next pagination
- Sortable column headers where the API supports sort
- Column show/hide for admins via `ColumnVisibilityMenu` + `useColumnVisibility`
- Prefer API-side filtering (`page`, `limit`, `sort`, `order`, `q`, …) with `{ items, pagination, sort }` responses

```tsx
const params = buildListParams({ page, limit, sort, order, filters: applied });
const result = await apiGet<PaginatedList<T>>(`/users?${params}`);
```
